# Prettier already reads .gitignore by default (its --ignore-path defaults to
# [.gitignore, .prettierignore]), so node_modules, dist, build, coverage,
# .turbo, test-results, .issues and the design-sync directories are covered
# there and are deliberately not repeated here.

# Markdown is authored prose, not code. content/**/*.md is parsed by
# @unimatrix/content and rendered on the public site, and AGENTS.md is the
# instruction file agents read; reformatting either buys nothing and would
# rewrite list markers and emphasis in text a human wrote.
**/*.md

# CLAUDE.md is a symlink to AGENTS.md. Prettier hard-errors on an explicitly
# named symlink ("Explicitly specified pattern ... is a symbolic link"), so it
# must stay ignored even if the *.md rule above is ever narrowed.
CLAUDE.md

# Verbatim upstream files. Reformatting one would break the byte-for-byte
# correspondence with the URL recorded beside it in vendor/NOTICE.md.
apps/cflop/vendor/

# Generated, not hand-edited.
pnpm-lock.yaml
**/routeTree.gen.ts
packages/db/drizzle/

# Local SQLite artifacts and their directory.
packages/db/local/

# Throwaway UX sketches on `lab/*` branches, excluded for the same reason they
# are excluded from lint and typecheck: a half-finished prototype must not turn
# `pnpm check` red. Empty on `main`, so this line does nothing there — it earns
# its keep on the branches where prototypes actually exist.
lab/prototypes/

# Google verification file — Google checks its exact bytes; formatting it
# breaks the check with no visible symptom beyond verification silently failing.
apps/cflop/public/google*.html
